{
 "about": "What each game hears change from today's engine, 0.4.1 from npm, to the engine built from this checkout: in Chromium and WebKit, in lockstep, as SCENARIOS in render.mjs plays each game, with the reverb and the compressor in. The whole mix; the mix again with the reverb left out on both, to tell a change of reverb draw from the rest; then each track alone, soloed. Per 2 s window: each engine's level, the change, and how far under today's music the difference sits. Today's reverb draws from Math.random, seeded with 1 here, so one draw stands for the many a listener hears on different loads. Windows quieter than -100 dBFS are left out of the summaries.",
